;; 撓 tawami — seed (Proof-of-Flexibility assets; MIXED provenance per row).
;;
;; Each row is a flexibility ASSET: a load/store that can shift WHEN it draws
;; energy. The derived flex-value rewards fast response, sustained duration,
;; large shiftable power, a wide time-shift window, and high availability.
;;
;; A SIZE (shiftable-kw, duration) is a fact, never a dispatch order. Rows default
;; to :representative; :authoritative rows fold a cited telemetry via an
;; operator-triggered G7 ingest.
;;
;; fields:
;;   :response-time-min  how fast it can begin responding (smaller = more valuable).
;;   :duration-min       how long it can sustain the shift.
;;   :shiftable-kw       the variable power it can move.
;;   :advance-window-h   how far EARLIER it can pull its draw.
;;   :defer-window-h     how far LATER it can push its draw.
;;   :availability       0..1 — fraction of time the flexibility is callable.
[
